From 0a6160d7b3290710daf2dbeaba73d4d50e93b684 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Fabrice Bellard <fabrice@bellard.org>
Date: Mon, 5 May 2025 15:59:04 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] avoid relying on 'FILE *' in JS_PrintValue() API

---
 quickjs-libc.c |  13 ++-
 quickjs.c      | 249 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-------------------
 quickjs.h      |   9 +-
